# Install HCVAT

Use the repository scripts for the full setup flow:

```sh
./scripts/docker_install.sh
./scripts/dev-clean-start.sh
```

The clean-start script also runs [scripts/install_nuclio_sam.sh](../../scripts/install_nuclio_sam.sh), which installs nuctl, starts the serverless stack, and deploys the SAM function.

After the services are up, open http://localhost and create an admin user with:

```sh
docker exec -it cvat_server bash -ic "python manage.py createsuperuser"
```

To stop or remove the containers later, you can use the helper scripts in [scripts](../../scripts).
